node_modules

# Output
.output
.vercel
.netlify
.wrangler
/.svelte-kit

# `/build` is deliberately absent from this list. The broker embeds it with
# `include_dir!` at compile time, and the machine that compiles the broker has a
# Rust toolchain and no node. Ignoring the output would make every release build
# serve a 404 where the dashboard should be. Run `pnpm build` and commit what it
# writes whenever anything under `src/` changes.

